<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 2: SECTION A ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="sec-hdr">甲部：多項選擇題（共 10 題，每題 3 分，共 30 分）</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 選出正確答案，在對應字母上畫圈 ○。每題只有一個正確答案。</div>
<table class="mcq">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">題號</th><th>題目</th><th>選項</th><th>答案</th></tr>
<tr>
<td class="lf-qn">1</td>
<td>計算 3.14 × 0.6 = ？</td>
<td class="opt">A. 0.1884<br/>B. 1.884<br/>C. 18.84<br/>D. 188.4</td>
<td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;">A B C D</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="lf-qn">2</td>
<td><span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> × <span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = ？</td>
<td class="opt">A. <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span><br/>B. <span class="f"><span class="n">6</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">15</span></span><br/>C. <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span><br/>D. <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">15</span></span></td>
<td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;">A B C D</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="lf-qn">3</td>
<td>4.8 ÷ 0.6 = ？</td>
<td class="opt">A. 0.8<br/>B. 8<br/>C. 80<br/>D. 800</td>
<td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;">A B C D</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="lf-qn">4</td>
<td><span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> ÷ <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> = ？</td>
<td class="opt">A. <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span><br/>B. <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span><br/>C. 1<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span><br/>D. 1<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span></td>
<td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;">A B C D</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="lf-qn">5</td>
<td>計算 1.5 × 2.4 ÷ 0.6 = ？</td>
<td class="opt">A. 0.6<br/>B. 6<br/>C. 3.6<br/>D. 9.6</td>
<td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;">A B C D</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="lf-qn">6</td>
<td><div style="text-align:center;margin:8px 0;padding:6px;background:#FAFBFC;border:1px solid var(--borderc);border-radius:4px;">
<div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:4px;">▲ 圓：半徑5cm（C=2πr）</div>
<div style="display:inline-block;max-width:280px;"><svg height="150" viewbox="0 0 170 150" width="170" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="85" cy="65" fill="#DBEAFE" r="55" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></circle><circle cx="85" cy="65" fill="#1A3C6D" r="3"></circle><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="85" y="58">O</text><line stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" x1="85" x2="140" y1="65" y2="65"></line><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="112" y="58">r</text><line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,2" stroke-width="2" x1="30" x2="140" y1="73" y2="73"></line><text fill="#DC2626" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="85" y="87">d=2r</text></svg></div>
</div>
一個圓的半徑是 5 cm，圓周是多少？（π = 3.14）</td>
<td class="opt">A. 15.7 cm<br/>B. 31.4 cm<br/>C. 78.5 cm<br/>D. 157 cm</td>
<td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;">A B C D</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="lf-qn">7</td>
<td><div style="text-align:center;margin:8px 0;padding:6px;background:#FAFBFC;border:1px solid var(--borderc);border-radius:4px;">
<div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:4px;">▲ 圓：直徑10cm（r=5·A=πr²）</div>
<div style="display:inline-block;max-width:280px;"><svg height="150" viewbox="0 0 170 150" width="170" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="85" cy="65" fill="#DBEAFE" r="55" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></circle><circle cx="85" cy="65" fill="#1A3C6D" r="3"></circle><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="85" y="58">O</text><line stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" x1="85" x2="140" y1="65" y2="65"></line><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="112" y="58">r</text><line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,2" stroke-width="2" x1="30" x2="140" y1="73" y2="73"></line><text fill="#DC2626" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="85" y="87">d=2r</text></svg></div>
</div>
一個圓的直徑是 10 cm，圓面積是多少？（π = 3.14）</td>
<td class="opt">A. 31.4 cm²<br/>B. 62.8 cm²<br/>C. 78.5 cm²<br/>D. 314 cm²</td>
<td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;">A B C D</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="lf-qn">8</td>
<td>計算 <span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> + <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？</td>
<td class="opt">A. <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span><br/>B. <span class="f"><span class="n">11</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span><br/>C. <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span><br/>D. <span class="f"><span class="n">7</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span></td>
<td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;">A B C D</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="lf-qn">9</td>
<td><div style="text-align:center;margin:8px 0;padding:6px;background:#FAFBFC;border:1px solid var(--borderc);border-radius:4px;">
<div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:4px;">▲ 半圓：r=6cm（周界=πr+2r！）</div>
<div style="display:inline-block;max-width:280px;"><svg height="150" viewbox="0 0 170 150" width="170" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="85" cy="65" fill="#DBEAFE" r="55" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></circle><circle cx="85" cy="65" fill="#1A3C6D" r="3"></circle><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="85" y="58">O</text><line stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" x1="85" x2="140" y1="65" y2="65"></line><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="112" y="58">r</text><line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,2" stroke-width="2" x1="30" x2="140" y1="73" y2="73"></line><text fill="#DC2626" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="85" y="87">d=2r</text></svg></div>
</div>
一個半圓，半徑 = 6 cm。半圓周長 = ？（π = 3.14）</td>
<td class="opt">A. 18.84 cm<br/>B. 30.84 cm<br/>C. 37.68 cm<br/>D. 49.68 cm</td>
<td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;">A B C D</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="lf-qn">10</td>
<td><span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> <div style="text-align:center;margin:8px 0;padding:6px;background:#FAFBFC;border:1px solid var(--borderc);border-radius:4px;">
<div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:4px;">▲ 1/4圓扇形：r=4cm</div>
<div style="display:inline-block;max-width:280px;"><svg height="150" viewbox="0 0 170 150" width="170" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="85" cy="65" fill="#DBEAFE" r="55" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></circle><circle cx="85" cy="65" fill="#1A3C6D" r="3"></circle><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="85" y="58">O</text><line stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" x1="85" x2="140" y1="65" y2="65"></line><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="112" y="58">r</text><line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,2" stroke-width="2" x1="30" x2="140" y1="73" y2="73"></line><text fill="#DC2626" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="85" y="87">d=2r</text></svg></div>
</div>
圓扇形，r = 4 cm。扇形周長 = ？（π = 3.14）</td>
<td class="opt">A. 6.28 cm<br/>B. 14.28 cm<br/>C. 12.56 cm<br/>D. 20.56 cm</td>
<td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;">A B C D</td>
</tr>
