<tr>
<td class="lf-qn">12</td>
<td>計算：<span class="fd"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> × <span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？（先約簡再乘）</td>
